{"id":"fac5c810f5035179","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-arithmetization.md","title":"Arithmetization","display":"df-arithmetization — Arithmetization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-arithmetization","aliases":["90-df-arithmetization"],"display":"df-arithmetization — Arithmetization","depends_on":["[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-numeral]]","[[88-df-satisfaction]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-arithmetization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-arithmetization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetization — Arithmetization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>环境包含固定解释的常量族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{SynOp}_r)_{r\\ge1}\">\\((\\mathrm{SynOp}_r)_{r\\ge1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathrm{SynRel}_r)_{r\\ge1}\">\\((\\mathrm{SynRel}_r)_{r\\ge1}\\)</span>；它们不是定义式中待存在量化的变量。每次调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}(\\mathrm{Syn},g)\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}(\\mathrm{Syn},g)\\)</span> 必须使用同一环境族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>标准模型满足关系直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d0aefc635fe57fc\" href=\"?note=7d0aefc635fe57fc\" title=\"88-df-satisfaction\">88-df-satisfaction</a>，经 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a> 的签名约定解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Syn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Syn}\\)</span> (语法对象集合)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Syn}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Syn}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (syntax encoding)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}\">\\(\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}\\)</span> (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}\\)</span> (arithmetization predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (arity parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\subseteq\\mathrm{Syn}^{\\mathrm{Syn}^r}\">\\(\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\subseteq\\mathrm{Syn}^{\\mathrm{Syn}^r}\\)</span> (选定的语法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 元操作族)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Syn}^r)\">\\(\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Syn}^r)\\)</span> (选定的语法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 元关系族)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature and standard structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(r)}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(r)}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (arithmetic formulas and numerals)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r,\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r,\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\\)</span> (arithmetically definable relations and total functions, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(r+1)\">\\((r+1)\\)</span> 元平铺图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a> 的解释元组，而不是另造的五元组。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\n\\exists\\rho(\\vec v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(r)}\\;\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec n\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\rho(\\overline{\\vec n})\\bigr)\n\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f:\\mathbb N^r\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\\in\\mathrm{ArithPred}_{r+1}\n\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Arith}(\\mathrm{Syn},g)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Syn}\\;\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall r\\geq1\\;\\forall O\\in\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\;\\exists f_O\\in\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathrm{Syn}^r\\;\ng(O(\\vec a))=f_O(g(a_0),\\ldots,g(a_{r-1}))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall r\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\;\\exists P_R\\in\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathrm{Syn}^r\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec a\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n(g(a_0),\\ldots,g(a_{r-1}))\\in P_R\\bigr)\n\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\n\\exists\\rho(\\vec v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(r)}\\;\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec n\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\rho(\\overline{\\vec n})\\bigr)\n\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\n&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f:\\mathbb N^r\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\\in\\mathrm{ArithPred}_{r+1}\n\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Arith}(\\mathrm{Syn},g)\n&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Syn}\\;\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall r\\geq1\\;\\forall O\\in\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\;\\exists f_O\\in\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathrm{Syn}^r\\;\ng(O(\\vec a))=f_O(g(a_0),\\ldots,g(a_{r-1}))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\n\\forall r\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\;\\exists P_R\\in\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathrm{Syn}^r\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec a\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n(g(a_0),\\ldots,g(a_{r-1}))\\in P_R\\bigr)\n\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>算术化是相对于显式选定的操作族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\)</span> 和关系族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\)</span> 的；它不仅要求有效编号，还要求这些操作与关系在编号下可由标准算术结构中的一阶公式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\\)</span> 的“可定义”条件现由公式见证和标准模型满足关系给出，不再由公式中的自然语言承担。</li>\n<li>解码器作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 有效性的存在见证被局部绑定，但所选操作族与关系族仍是已列明的环境常量；两个参数的调用接口不表示结果与这些族无关。</li>\n<li>核心工具：Gödel编码 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b86b211a75cf1748\" href=\"?note=b86b211a75cf1748\" title=\"90-df-godel-numbering\">90-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li>使&quot;证明&quot;、&quot;公式&quot;等成为算术概念</li>\n<li>这是Gödel不完备性定理的关键技术</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"7d0aefc635fe57fc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"7d0aefc635fe57fc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"标准模型满足关系直接取 [[88-df-satisfaction]]，经 [[90-df-formula]] 的签名约定解释。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"标准模型满足关系直接取 [[88-df-satisfaction]]，经 [[90-df-formula]] 的签名约定解释。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}$ (effective Gödel-numbering predicate, see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ and $\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ (arithmetic signature and standard structure, see [[90-df-arithmetic-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Graph}$ 直接取 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $(r+1)$ 元平铺图；$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 是 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的解释元组，而不是另造的五元组。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Graph}$ 直接取 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $(r+1)$ 元平铺图；$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 是 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的解释元组，而不是另造的五元组。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b86b211a75cf1748","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"核心工具：Gödel编码 (see [[90-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathrm{SynOp}_r)_{r\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathrm{SynRel}_r)_{r\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arith}(\\mathrm{Syn},g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Syn}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathrm{Syn}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arith}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\subseteq\\mathrm{Syn}^{\\mathrm{Syn}^r}","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Syn}^r)","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r,\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Graph}","display":false},{"tex":"(r+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetization}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\left\\{\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\n&\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r:\n\\exists\\rho(\\vec v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{(r)}\\;\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^r\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec n\\in P\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\models\\rho(\\overline{\\vec n})\\bigr)\n\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\n&\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{f:\\mathbb N^r\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\operatorname{Graph}(f)\\in\\mathrm{ArithPred}_{r+1}\n\\right\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Arith}(\\mathrm{Syn},g)\n&\\leftrightarrow\n\\Biggl[\n\\mathcal N_{\\mathrm{arith}}=\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\exists d:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathrm{Syn}\\;\n\\mathrm{GN}_{\\mathrm{Syn}}(g,d)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\forall r\\geq1\\;\\forall O\\in\\mathrm{SynOp}_r\\;\\exists f_O\\in\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathrm{Syn}^r\\;\ng(O(\\vec a))=f_O(g(a_0),\\ldots,g(a_{r-1}))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\n\\forall r\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{SynRel}_r\\;\\exists P_R\\in\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r\\;\n\\forall\\vec a\\in\\mathrm{Syn}^r\\;\n\\bigl(\\vec a\\in R\\leftrightarrow\n(g(a_0),\\ldots,g(a_{r-1}))\\in P_R\\bigr)\n\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynOp}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SynRel}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithPred}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithFn}_r","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false}],"bytes":3719,"backlinks":[{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetization]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-ope